      "check": "enabled-foreground-runtime-consults-github-jsdelivr-aws-manifest-roots-in-declared-order-verifies-each-and-installs-only-the-strictly-newest-signed-root-whose-objects-are-fetched-only-through-pattern-validated-sha256-names-under-the-three-reviewed-object-bases-on-a-checked-ten-minute-wake-and-reads-list-refresh-not-before-with-exception-safe-raw-type-exact-long-validation-so-read-exception-wrong-type-overflow-or-implausible-value-pauses-fail-closed-and-persists-each-attempts-deadline-across-pause-resume-and-process-recreation-re-advances-that-durable-deadline-from-worker-start-rejection-time-so-ordinary-resume-cannot-retry-early-while-forced-refresh-is-the-only-bounded-viewer-scoped-bypass-and-does-not-clear-or-transfer-that-deadline-independent-of-mutation-limits-and-fetch-never-enumerates-targets-into-block-work",
      "severity": "error"
    },
    {
      "id": "passive-visible-scheduler-contract",
      "check": "main-thread-only-authority grants and lock-serialized off-main revocation feed one currently visible immutable numeric id per manual-first fresh scheduler drain; invalid-store generation and username conflicts fail closed; callback-free native already-blocked preflight precedes running persistence and passive delay reservation; full authority is rechecked immediately before running persistence, reservation, and bridge dispatch under the generation-replacement lock; the passive deadline is atomically persisted before dispatch and never cleared or shortened afterward; no target-run-hour-day admission or visible-set batch remains",
